(text "nice!nano v2 clone (nRF52840). Matrix is col2row: diode cathode on the row, anode toward the switch.\nSolder the three bottom pins (P1.01 ROW9, P1.02 ROW10, P1.07 ROW11) as well as the side headers.\nP0.31 is the backlight enable (ZMK PWM). P0.15 is the module LED and P0.13 switches VCC; neither is used." (at 199.39 99.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "e2fc4e12-6dd3-4a23-bf9c-4c9db4a765f2"))
